            "pos": "noun",
            "senses": [
                {
                    "sense_id": "208c52b2-4468-3bf7-938a-894e11025164",
                    "sense_definition": "A tube held in the mouth or attached to a mask, used by swimmers to breathe underwater while swimming near the surface.",
